  <h3>What to Look for in High-End Activewear Manufacturing</h3>
  <p>When you view our raw videos, pay close attention to these three markers of premium quality that distinguish Fitclo from entry-level manufacturers:</p>

  <h4>1. The 4-Way Stretch Recovery Test</h4>
  <p>Many fabrics stretch, but few <em>recover</em> perfectly. In our videos, you can see our high-gauge Nylon/Spandex blends being pulled to their limit and instantly snapping back to their original shape. This ensures your brand avoids the "baggy knee" or "sagging waist" complaints common in lower-tier products.</p>

  <h4>2. High-Density Interlock Knit (100% Squat-Proof)</h4>
  <p>We show our leggings under high-tension lighting to prove transparency. Our 280-320 GSM interlock fabrics are engineered for total opacity. Even under maximum stretch, the fabric maintains its color depth and provides a secure, non-see-through experience for the end-user.</p>

