  <h4>3. The Precision of 4-Needle 6-Thread Seams</h4>
  <p>A raw video allows you to see the "density" of the stitching. We use industrial-grade flatlock machines that create a seamless, chafe-free interior. This isn't just for comfort—it's for durability. These seams are designed to outlast the life of the fabric itself.</p>

  <h3>Our "Video-First" Sampling Process</h3>
  <p>For our established partners in the US, EU, and UK, we offer a specialized sampling workflow:
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Step 1:</strong> Select your styles or send your tech pack.</li>
    <li><strong>Step 2:</strong> We record a personalized raw video of the fabric and sample construction.</li>
    <li><strong>Step 3:</strong> You review the technical details digitally, saving weeks of transit time before the physical sample is even shipped.</li>
  </ul>

